{
  "intro": [
    {
      "text": "YOU'RE SO\nLAZY!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "YOU WERE\nNAPPING\nALL NIGHT!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "* i think that's called...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* sleeping.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "EXCUSES,\nEXCUSES!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "introAgain": [
    {
      "text": "REALLY THOUGH!!!\nTHAT HUMAN!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusmad",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "DO I KNOW THAT\nPERSON???",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyruslaugh",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "* do you not know...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* who you know?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "PBPBPPBPT!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "OF COURSE I KNOW\nWHO I KNOW!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "I WANTED TO KNOW IF\nYOU KNOW...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "I KNOW WHO I KNOW\nAS MUCH AS I KNOW\nI KNOW WHO I KNOW!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "...YOU KNOW?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyruslaugh",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
  "explain": [
    {
      "text": "OH-HO!\nTHE HUMAN\nARRIVES!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "IN ORDER TO\nSTOP YOU...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "MY BROTHER AND\nI HAVE CREATED\nSOME PUZZLES!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "I THINK YOU\nWILL FIND\nTHIS ONE...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "QUITE\nSHOCKING!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyruslaugh",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "FOR YOU SEE,\nTHIS IS THE\nINVISIBLE...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "ELECTRICITY\nMAZE!!!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "WHEN YOU TOUCH\nTHE WALLS OF\nTHIS MAZE,",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THIS ORB WILL\nADMINISTER A\nHEARTY ZAP!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "SOUND LIKE\nFUN???",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyruslaugh",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "BECAUSE!",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyruslaugh",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "THE AMOUNT OF\nFUN YOU WILL\nPROBABLY HAVE,",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyruslaugh",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "IS ACTUALLY\nRATHER SMALL\nI THINK.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrusside",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    },
    {
      "text": "OK, YOU CAN\nGO AHEAD NOW.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_papyrus",
      "font": "fnt_papyrus"
    }
  ],
